### IQA UI Styling

#### `IQAReferenceTarget`

An enum that defines which view the IQA result area should anchor to.

```swift
public enum IQAReferenceTarget {
    case container            // equals self (and typically uses safe area)
    case containerNoSafeArea  // self without safe area
    case overlayImage         // progressImageContainerView
    case ocrPhoto             // ocrPhotoImageContainerView
    case footerView
}
```

### Cases

* **`container`** – The controller’s main container respecting safe areas.
* **`containerNoSafeArea`** – The main container ignoring safe areas (full-bleed).
* **`overlayImage`** – The overlay image container (e.g., guidance/placeholder).
* **`ocrPhoto`** – The captured document preview container.
* **`footerView`** – The footer area (usually housing actions).

***

#### `IQAPositionedArea`

Defines how the IQA result area is positioned and sized relative to a reference target.

```swift
public struct IQAPositionedArea {
    public var target: IQAReferenceTarget
    public var horizontal: UdentifyHorizontalSizing
    public var vertical: UdentifyVerticalSizing
    public var useSafeArea: Bool

    public init(
        target: IQAReferenceTarget,
        horizontal: UdentifyHorizontalSizing,
        vertical: UdentifyVerticalSizing,
        useSafeArea: Bool = true
    )
}
```

### Properties

| Property      | Type                       | Description                                                        | Default |
| ------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------- |
| `target`      | `IQAReferenceTarget`       | Which view to anchor/position the result area to.                  | —       |
| `horizontal`  | `UdentifyHorizontalSizing` | Horizontal sizing strategy (e.g., anchors/insets/fixed width).     | —       |
| `vertical`    | `UdentifyVerticalSizing`   | Vertical sizing strategy (e.g., fixed height + top/bottom offset). | —       |
| `useSafeArea` | `Bool`                     | Whether to respect safe-area insets of the `target`.               | `true`  |

### Usage Example

```swift
let resultPositioning = IQAPositionedArea(
    target: .ocrPhoto,
    horizontal: .anchors(leading: 0, trailing: 0),
    vertical: .fixed(height: 0, verticalPosition: .bottom(offset: 40)),
    useSafeArea: false
)
```

