| `failureBannerStyle`           | `IQABannerStyle`            | Error banner style (validation failed).               |
| `reasonBannerStyle`            | `IQABannerStyle`            | “Reason” banner style (detailed hints).               |
| `successBannerStyle`           | `IQABannerStyle`            | Success banner style.                                 |
| `successButtonStyle`           | `UdentifyButtonStyle`       | Primary action (e.g., **Next/Continue**) on success.  |
| `retakeButtonStyle`            | `UdentifyButtonStyle`       | Secondary action to retake capture.                   |
| `progressBarStyle`             | `UdentifyProgressBarStyle?` | Progress bar styling while IQA runs.                  |
| `dismissAfterSuccessInSeconds` | `TimeInterval?`             | Auto-dismiss delay after success.                     |

***

#### `IQABannerStyle`

A reusable style for IQA banners (failure, reason, success).

```swift
public struct IQABannerStyle: UdentifyBaseViewStyle {
    public var backgroundColor: UIColor
    public var borderColor: UIColor
    public let iconColor: UIColor
    public var cornerRadius: CGFloat
    public private(set) var borderWidth: CGFloat
    public let titleLabelStyle: UdentifyTextStyle
    public let descriptionLabelStyle: UdentifyTextStyle
    public var verticalPadding: CGFloat
    public var horizontalPadding: CGFloat
    public var iconSize: CGSize
}
```

### Properties & Defaults

| Property                | Type                | Description                            | Default                 |
| ----------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| `backgroundColor`       | `UIColor`           | Banner background color.               | —                       |
| `borderColor`           | `UIColor`           | Banner border color.                   | `.clear`                |
| `iconColor`             | `UIColor`           | Tint color for the banner icon.        | `.black`                |
| `cornerRadius`          | `CGFloat`           | Corner radius.                         | `8`                     |
| `borderWidth`           | `CGFloat` (clamped) | Public read-only; clamped to `0...15`. | `0`                     |
| `titleLabelStyle`       | `UdentifyTextStyle` | Title text style.                      | Bold 16, black, left    |
| `descriptionLabelStyle` | `UdentifyTextStyle` | Description text style.                | Regular 14, black, left |
| `verticalPadding`       | `CGFloat`           | Vertical content padding.              | `15`                    |
| `horizontalPadding`     | `CGFloat`           | Horizontal content padding.            | `16`                    |
| `iconSize`              | `CGSize`            | Icon size.                             | `30×30`                 |

